              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JollyCurd1306"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely delicious. Instead of adding l/8 teaspoon hot pepper sauce I used 1 tablespoon of Best Foods Spicy Mayonnaise Dressing (Medium). Great Taste !!!",
            "datePublished": "2022-08-29T19:18:23.981Z"
          },
