            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Donna Stone"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good... like a BLT, minus the B. I used spinach leaves instead of lettuce, like another reviewer. I'm pretty lax in getting my veggies, so I took advantage of this.\n\nupdated: I substituted the lettuce/spinach for cucumber slices and added extra hot sauce and pepper. Also used celery salt instead of regular salt, to go for sort of a \"Bloody Mary\" sandwich. I liked it better.",
            "datePublished": "2010-06-06T17:51:53.903Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GodivaGirl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used french bread which I had leftover in place of the wheat bread. Instead of using the ketchup, I used a small amount of thousand island dressing mixed with the hot sauce. If you like a \"kick\" with the hot sauce, use the amount in the recipe. Next time I will use less. I also added turkey bacon.",
            "datePublished": "2008-07-20T09:08:25.513Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
